comments.body:
Yeah, that's a good point. One reason we didn't add it was that the aggregate results depend on _how_ the unprocessed metrics were aggregated, e.g. which filters were applied. And we didn't want to have "free floating" `aggregated_metrcis.parquet` lying around without that info attached to them. 
But I guess by now we haven't changed the filtering in a while, so we can consider it stable...? 
@mwatson-nvidia - what do you think?
